# candidate T19 Change 4 -- CACHED transformed A
#   PolyMatrix::prepare forward-transforms every entry once;
#   PreparedMatrix::apply then does pointwise MAC only, so the left
#   operand's twist+forward vanish: 7168 modular multiplies per term
#   per prime against the fused dot's 13312 and the unfused 21528.
